{"version":1,"content":"<p>微軟目前正在計劃從 2027 年開始將 WiFi 驅動程序移出 Windows 11 內核，即改成用户模式運行。微軟的目的是減少 WiFi 驅動程序引起的黑屏死機問題，這項改進預計會在 2027 年發佈的 Windows 11 中推出。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587646.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T12:23:51.505837+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T12:05:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T12:17:11.348703+00:00","content_hash":"d81e3dc3e0c36904b97ec0a9cb83f274b6bd75e3f12ec93337f78ad0d068d692","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}